        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Behavior and output"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Because a versionless component version is typically the only version (or, at least, the latest component version) in a component, Antora automatically routes any incoming references that originate from other components that don’t specify a version coordinate to it. However, in rare cases, such as when referencing a versionless prerelease from another component version, you can use the reserved keyword "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "_"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " (an underscore) as the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "version coordinate in the resource ID"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "page:resource-id-coordinates.html#id-version"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "xref:_@component:module:file.adoc[]"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") to reference a versionless component version."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "reference-a-versionless-resource",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Reference a versionless resource"
